    title: "RSS Readers for a Calmer Internet: Feedly vs Inoreader vs NetNewsWire",
    metaTitle: "Best RSS Readers for a Calmer Internet: No-Hype Guide",
    description: "A practical RSS-reader comparison covering Feedly, Inoreader, NetNewsWire and the no-buy option by platform, filtering, privacy, export and workflow.",
    dek: "RSS does not make the internet quiet. It replaces an engagement-ranked entrance with a list of sources you chose—and gives you a visible stopping point.",
